WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.430
In 1960, Thailand's first year of tourism
promotion brought 81,340 visitors.

2
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:12.310
In 2010, foreign arrivals
reached 15.9 million.

3
00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:18.870
By 2019, 39.9 million:
about 2.5 times as many.

4
00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.330
Temples, festivals and village
life draw many of them.

5
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:26.310
That is a lot of visitors,
and a lot of spending.

6
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.070
So who in Thailand actually gained?

7
00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:34.670
In this mission, you'll sort tourism work
into formal jobs and the informal economy.

8
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.290
Then you'll weigh
tourism's effects on jobs,

9
00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:41.210
places, the environment,
culture and infrastructure.

10
00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:46.630
Your mission: decide who in Thailand actually
gained from almost 40 million foreign

11
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:47.650
tourists.
